What you heard there, that was my scouts, my troop,

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Last week cheering in the dining hall. we were at summer camp and we had a wonderful time.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:01:09,000
This is Podcast Number 231..

7
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Welcome back to the Scoutmaster Podcast. This is Clark Green.

8
